// Cespenar can forge SoA items (component 9000), from Item Randomiser's
// baf/botsmith.baf, added at the top of BOTSMITH.BCS: when the forging
// cutscene ends (ImpForgeStuff), Cespenar hands over the item of the recipe
// d/botsmith.d chose (flItemMaker) and talks to the protagonist again.

IF
  Global("flItemMaker","GLOBAL",1)
  Global("ImpForgeStuff","GLOBAL",1)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("ImpForgeStuff","GLOBAL",0)
    GiveItemCreate("plat06",Player1,0,0,0)
    StartDialogueNoSet(Player1)
END

